(
    id: "tutorial_first_raid",
    title: "GC Entropy Sweep",
    body: "The garbage collector has found your base. A sweep does not come for you — it comes for your structures, and it will keep coming.\n\nStaff posted at a machine defend it, and take damage doing so. A program that goes down is not lost: it keeps its slot on the roster and walks itself to a Repair Bay, if one is standing.\n\nMore bodies and more Bays are the answer. An empty base is a base that loses buildings.",
    glyph: '!',
    color: Red,
    repeat: OnceEver,
)
